    },
    {
        "text": "4:45 A.M. \\ Clear",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "text": "L.G.D. Headquarters Rooftop Ruins, Upper Lungmen",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "offsetx": -300,
        "width": 200,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Ch'en, I believe Amiya is right next to you. Can you hear me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, Chief Wei.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Very well then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "I must apologize, leader of Rhodes Island. Though I can risk sending the L.G.D. deep into enemy territory, I can't risk bringing any more players into this game.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Bringing more players in?;...What do you mean by that?;The situation out there is already chaotic.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname}...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Beneath this entire land lies an invisible, yet intricate net.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "No single city can break free from this net of conspiracy and intrigue - and especially not Lungmen, as it is situated in the midsts of giants.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps you already know this, perhaps you don't. Nevertheless, I have to take all these factors into consideration.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Chief Wei, you should have shared this information with us if you wanted our mission to progress more smoothly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "At least, you should have told me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I must apologize yet again, Miss Amiya. From my position, I simply cannot disclose all our intel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you were standing in my shoes, you would have made the same decision.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "What happened in the Chernobog ruins was a pity, but at least you achieved something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You used us to draw Reunion's attention.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No, the L.G.D. was right there with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "You used all of us as bait.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "He planned for all this a long time ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion's infiltration only deepens as time passes, so he had to quickly make a decision.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_rooftop",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "At the most crucial moment, when Reunion was most vulnerable...",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Rhodes Island was made to draw their attention.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "He led Reunion to believe that the L.G.D. had been separated\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_rooftop",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "...and fooled them into thinking that Lungmen was undefended.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "offsetx": -300,
        "width": 200,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, well said, Dr. {@nickname}! Chief, of course you'd need us to hold Reunion back. The more the better, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "When the lurking Reunion saw Lungmen in such a state, there's no way they wouldn't spring at the opportunity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "And as soon as they began to emerge from their lairs, then BAM! Lungmen's elite forces would be waiting for them, seemingly out of nowhere.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "How long have you been concealing Lungmen's power? Did you already start preparing for this after the Chernobog incident?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Lungmen kept you safe, and helped you return to a position that could maximize your value.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You left Amiya to die back there in the middle of so many enemies. What kind of 'position' are you talking about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I just hope that Rhodes Island can understand that we all have to face this difficult situation together.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Blaze, Dr. {@nickname}, it's fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Swire helped us to defeat Reunion's forces, together. Lungmen did not abandon us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "(We don't have any proof.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Our agreement is still valid. No matter what happened during the process, only the end result can satisfy me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter what happened.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname} of Rhodes Island, I believe I made myself clear the last time we met.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "You do not have a choice in this matter. But at least you can choose how you eliminate your enemies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I don't believe you or the snake oil you peddle.;...;Nobody will happily smile and go on their way after being deceived.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Isn't that for the best?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "We should all stay alert. Nobody should let their guard down when we are facing a common enemy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your vigilance can keep you from falling into a trap.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen, Dr. {@nickname}\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "...We may not be friends yet, but at least we are not enemies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So, silence is your answer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "A fine display of judgment. You would hide your weaknesses while pressing your advantages.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island indeed is a powerful partner. You have earned my recognition from this incident.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, this comes on the condition that our relationship is still a partnership, not a statement of the status between illegal Infected and local authorities.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "text": "I do not intend to fool anyone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Though, objectively speaking, I may well have fooled Reunion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "But none of that can be proven. Reunion may also have access to our secrets.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can only hope to destroy them before they come to grasp our strategies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, does this goal motivate you at all?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate"
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Amiya, Dr. {@nickname}, the cooperation between us has not ended yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "A counterattack is imminent. We will demonstrate Lungmen's stature, wisdom, and unity to them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "If possible, I would also like to witness Rhodes Island's professionalism, resolve, and bravery.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "In fifteen minutes, Madam Ch'en will return to fight at your side.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister Wei, I hope you don't forget what you just said.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because Rhodes Island will not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Naturally.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Blaze, Dr. {@nickname}, let's go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, by the way, Madam Ch'en, where's Inspector Hoshiguma? I don't see her around. Is she... all right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She had some minor injuries, nothing serious.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, I see...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Ch'en, Rhodes Island can also give you a checkup and provide some quick treatment if needed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No thanks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't have to worry about anything, our medical procedures are completely confidential.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A little bit of elbow grease is good enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm... If you insist, then I won't force you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "In that case, I'll see you later then, Madam Ch'en.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_lungmen_o",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "5:00 A.M. \\ Clear",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "text": "Chief's Office, Upper Lungmen",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "offsetx": -300,
        "width": 200,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Chief Wei, how was everything on your end?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Good, of course. Otherwise, I wouldn't have time to chat with you here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did they agree to slow down the operation?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, but there is a time limit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Today, and tomorrow. If Reunion is still not contained after two days, you know what will happen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Only two days?! That's not enough time! I can't\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Two days and nights are already too generous. In comparison, I will only give you one day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "One day?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I want you to take care of everything within a day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Chief Wei, if they can help us, we can get rid of Reunion within hours. Wouldn't that minimize our losses?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not important. Lungmen should be able to handle its own problems, once and for all. That is our first principle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "That is what we need to demonstrate to them. So, everyone, get moving.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go, Madam Ch'en. It is time to show Reunion some Lungmen hospitality.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "offsetx": -300,
        "width": 200,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Chief Wei, I do have one question. Even if you can't answer right now, I hope you can give me a reasonable guess after everything is over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You may ask.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This is supposed to be Reunion's all-out attack. In that case, why has their leader, Talulah, not appeared in Lungmen?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought things were progressing smoothly. Why are you frowning, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fumizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Have we received any response from Ursus?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Still nothing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fumizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And we still can't get in contact with Speaker Witte?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Unfortunately, our messenger hasn't even been able to meet him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fumizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "By the looks of things, the Ursus Empire is completely opaque.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fumizuki, I have a premonition. That this whole thing is just the start of something much bigger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The last time I heard you say that was many years ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fumizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "When did I say that? I've completely forgotten why I would say something like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That was right after we first met. Are you saying that you've forgotten about everything that's ever happened between us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fumizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "N-no way! How could I! I just can't remember most things apart from our time together.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Nice try, you sweet-talker. Unfortunately, this isn't something you'll be able to forget.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fumizuki"
    },
    {
        "text": "You said this to my face twenty years ago... that if we lost, this city would be under a different name, and become just another stepping stone on the path to Ursus hegemony.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fumizuki"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we had lost, you wouldn't be the one sitting here. He would.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fumizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Duke of Kashchey.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Alas, poor Tal. Don't you think she reminds us of him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fumizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But he's already dead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Killed by Talulah herself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
